 "path": "/news/owlets-art-and-horses",
 "title": "Owlets, Art and Horses!",
 "description": "Check out our August 2019 Newsletter here.",
 "html": "<p>\n <img src=\"/media/news__owlets-art-and-horses/43b51e00ba.jpeg\" alt=\"Horses stables\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </p>\n<table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <strong>We are in the Press &gt;&gt;&gt; Barn Owls make great stable mates!</strong></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/Hussein%20ringing%20%283%29_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/IMG_20190807_155859%20%282%29_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/Screenshot_2019-08-15-16-49-17_233x175.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n <p>\n Barn Owls (<em>Tyto alba</em>) are a common sight at the Steyn City Equestrian Centre. This year will be the 3rd year running where Barn Owls have successfully bred in an EcoSolutions owl box and produced a healthy clutch of owlets! </p>\n <p>\n Residents of Chartwell, please welcome two beautiful Barn Owlets to your neighbourhood &gt;&gt;&gt; K52462 and K52463.</p>\n <p>\n <strong><a href=\"/news/barn-owls-tyto-alba-thrive-in-chartwell\">Click here to read the full story!</a></strong></p>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <strong>*** Spotted Eagle Owlets at Stratford Gardens ***</strong></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/IMG-20190815-WA0014_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/IMG-20190815-WA0090_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Owl%20ringing/IMG-20190815-WA0091_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n <p>\n We received a call from a concerned resident at Stratford Gardens, Fourways, about two Spotted Eagle Owlets (<em>Bubo africanus</em>) on the ground. After receiving the all-clear from Johannesburg Wildlife Vet, the residents helped us put rings on the owlets and the owlets were safely placed back in the owl box. </p>\n <p>\n To the Fourways community, we would like to introduce you to two healthy Spotted Eagle Owlets &gt;&gt;&gt; 890055 and 890056.</p>\n <p>\n <strong><a href=\"/news/spotted-eagle-owlets-at-stratford-gardens\">Click here to read the full story!</a></strong></p>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <strong>Make sure your owl box is an Owl Home this spring!</strong></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Occupied%20owl%20box%20pics/IMG-20180918-WA0024_233x174.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Occupied%20owl%20box%20pics/Cindy%20Neethling%20Sept%202016_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/Occupied%20owl%20box%20pics/IMG_4938_233x175.JPG\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <p>\n <strong>It is not too late to have your owl box maintained and serviced to ensure that your owl box is an Owl Home!</strong></p>\n <p>\n The reason for the annual service is twofold - to make sure that the box is still secure and in a good condition and to replenish the gravel substrate on which the female owls lay their eggs. </p>\n <p>\n <strong>**</strong>Without a substrate, owls will not use the box<strong>**</strong></p>\n <p>\n <strong>The annual owl box service fee is <a href=\"https://ecosolutions.myshopify.com/collections/owls/products/annual-owl-box-service-1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">R640.00</a>. </strong></p>\n <p>\n <strong>Book your owl box service today through our online shop <a href=\"https://ecosolutions.myshopify.com/collections/owls/products/annual-owl-box-service-1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></strong>. Alternatively, simply reply to this newsletter and we will take it from there.</p>\n <p>\n If you are unsure why your owl box requires an annual 'revamp', please have a read through our 'Still Empty' page <a href=\"/owls-and-owl-boxes/empty\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</p>\n <p>\n Our newest owl homes are in Rynfield, Benoni and in Waterkloof, Pretoria! Well done!</p>\n <p>\n <strong>Together, we are creating the largest Urban Owl Box Project in Africa!</strong></p>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"3\">\n <strong>*** 2019 Annual Art Project is... a 3D Owl Puzzle ***</strong></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"2\">\n <table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/owlproject_org_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/WhatsApp%20Image%202019-08-26%20at%2014_28_08_233x175.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/download_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"2\">\n <p>\n For the past 4 years, <a href=\"http://owlproject.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">owlproject.org</a> and children from township schools have created amazing owl themed artwork. Part of this art collection is now in Houston (USA), Portugal and Austria!</p>\n <p>\n This year, the learners chose a 3D Owl Puzzle and <a href=\"http://owlproject.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">owlproject.org</a> couldn't resist! Each unit costs R500.00 to cut and colour. <a href=\"http://owlproject.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Owlproject.org</a> needs your support to reach their goal of <strong>50 3D Owl Puzzles</strong>!</p>\n <p>\n <a href=\"http://owlproject.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Owlproject.org</a> has a number of easy ways<strong> for you to make your donation</strong> - please click <a href=\"https://owlproject.org/Support-Us/Donors/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Any donation would be a huge help to cover various costs to make this art project a reality! </p>\n <p>\n <strong>Without education, there can be no conservation.</strong></p>\n <p>\n For the full story and <a href=\"http://owlproject.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">owlproject.org</a>'s contact details please chick <a href=\"/news/owlproject.org-needs-your-support\">here</a>.</p>\n </td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"2\">\n <table>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/Alex%20Owl%20Art%202017_233x175.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/IMG_3949_233x175.JPG\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n <td>\n <img src=\"https://www.contacton.com/references/resource?onRN01=mnVFB1Q6MTaFqAxpbYPBZom6O4Msd9l5ZTp3boznZXMN&fileName=/images/TOP/3d%20puzzle%20letter_233x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n </table>\n </td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
